WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.640
Now, the world will be an easier place to live!

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.060
Louis XVI is a person of simple interests.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.090
The price of bread and meat should come down.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.940
<i>June 11, 1775.</i>

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>The coronation ceremony of Louis XVI,</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:47.910
<i>the new King of France, is about to take place at Reims Cathedral.</i>

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:59.500
<i>Following tradition, Louis XVI must ascend
the central 40-step stairway alone,</i>

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.060
<i>before he is crowned King.</i>

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.590
<i>He looks just like the illustrations
of the successive Kings,</i>

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:31.830
<i>from the French history textbooks, I saw long ago.</i>

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.560
<i>How marvelous!</i>

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:46.310
Following God's will, I, Louis XVI,
hereby declare myself, Ruler of France!

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:50.070
Long live His Majesty, Louis XVI!

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.420
Long live France!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.630
Hurray!

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:07.360
<i>Now, I am the Queen of France.</i>

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:13.070
<i>From this moment on, I am the Queen of France,
the most beautiful country in all of Europe!</i>

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:19.210
Long live His Majesty, Louis XVI!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:22.210
Long live His Queen!

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.580
Long live France!

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.500
Hurray!

