00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.890
episode

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.890
"The
\hBeautiful Devil, Jeanne"

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:17.160
<i>On this day, after the coronation ceremony,
the new King and Queen,</i>

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.790
<i>visited the School of Louis-le-Grand
to receive a congratulatory speech.</i>

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:27.600
We trust the reign of King Louis XVI shall bring
prosperity and happiness to his people.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.570
As such, we would like to offer our
congratulations with this speech.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:36.140
What is the name of that pale-faced student,
who just read the congratulatory speech?

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.110
Yes.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.920
I'm honored to inform you, his name is Maximilien
de Robespierre from the law department.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.220
Robespierre, huh?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.580
<i>Robespierre.</i>

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:52.390
<i>He would later be known far and wide, as the most radical leader of the French Revolution.</i>

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.990
<i>These were the days of his youth.</i>

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.830
Life will only get better now.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:10.010
After all, the last King was the kind of person who spent all of our tax money on Madame du Barry.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.700
Yeah, I'm sure everything
will become cheaper now.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.210
<i>It'd be so helpful, if that really happens...</i>

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.500
Jeanne?!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.100
Could it really be...?!

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:58.930
<i>Jeanne ran away from home
and abandoned me and mom...</i>

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.950
<i>So why does she seem like a lady,
who lives at that manor?</i>

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.280
<i>Could it be someone else?</i>

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.340
<i>But she looks just like her!</i>

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:15.530
<i>It is Jeanne!</i>

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.640
<i>But I can't speak to her.</i>

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:24.680
<i>It'd probably cause her trouble, if her younger
sister were to show up in such filthy clothes.</i>

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.520
<i>Jeanne...</i>

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.540
<i>She always used to dream
about her life as a lady...</i>

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.660
<i>...and wanted to leave our home.</i>

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.170
<i>It's all so mystifying...</i>

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.630
Rosalie.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.370
Rosalie.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.480
What is it, Mom?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.890
You were thinking about
Jeanne again, weren't you?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.260
Yes, Jeanne was too beautiful
to be in a place like this.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.600
It makes sense that she left.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.060
After all, Jeanne is different from me somehow...

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.950
It's as though she were the only one who was passed down with noble blood.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.200
Wh-What are you saying, Rosalie?!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.410
Jeanne isn't...

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.590
In fact, you're the one who—

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.770
Mom?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.370
Why do you look so serious all of the sudden?

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:22.420
Mom!

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:25.180
You need to get your rest.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.960
I'll heat up some soup.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.350
The woman next door gave us potatoes.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.480
Oh, Jeanne!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.640
Your new dress suits you so well.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:57.850
Thank you, Marquise Boulainvilliers.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.910
Call me Auntie in front of other people.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.380
Yes, Auntie.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:06.520
Refined speech, proper etiquette,
which is very complicated, dance, piano...

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:10.460
She's mastered everything in
such a short period of time.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:16.180
She's such a fast learner,
there's nothing else for me to teach her.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:20.400
She can hold her own as a fine lady,
no matter where she goes now.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.100
Yes, indeed.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.870
<i>Of course I can.</i>

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.170
<i>Why do you think I worked so bloody hard,
not sleeping at night,</i>

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:30.040
<i>to learn how to come off as a lady?</i>

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:35.070
<i>Now, I can show you my real talents.</i>

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.570
<i>Just you watch.</i>

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.080
Tea is served.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.250
Thank you.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:45.040
Say, Auntie, when will you take
me to the Palace of Versailles?

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.700
Jeanne, I'm sure I've
mentioned this to you, before,

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:52.010
but our House hasn't been
permitted to take part at court yet.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.230
Come, let's have some tea.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:01.510
<i>She's a generous woman, but I didn't
realize her lineage was mediocre.</i>

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:04.350
<i>My goal is much higher than this!</i>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.020
<i>I'm going to live in Versailles
and live like a queen someday!</i>

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.910
<i>I'll do anything to attain my goal!</i>

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.790
<i>Anything...!</i>

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.730
Then, Ma'am, starting tomorrow my job is...?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:30.640
Yes, I'm sorry, but do come back
when things get better.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.040
<i>What am I going to do?</i>

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.240
<i>Anyhow, I need to find another place to work.</i>

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.810
<i>Please!</i>

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.350
<i>Please give me work!</i>

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.350
<i>No, I can't.</i>

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.950
<i>I'll peel potatoes! I'll do anything!</i>

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.230
<i>Sorry, but we have more than enough people.</i>

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:52.360
<i>I thought life would become a
little easier under the new King...</i>

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.730
I'm hungry...

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:57.740
I don't care what. I just need work...

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.870
God, please help me!

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.310
Jeanne...

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.880
Please help me and mom!

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:37.030
<i>Jeanne will probably be troubled,
if I were to visit looking so ragged...</i>

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.700
<i>But I have no one else to turn to!</i>

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.050
Rosalie?!

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.780
Yes, that's right.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.690
<i>It's her!</i>

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.090
<i>What could she want after all this time?!</i>

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.390
<i>We have guests over today!</i>

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.850
Jeanne!

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:03.350
Rosalie!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.370
It really is you, Jeanne!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.560
You look so beautiful...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.400
I hardly recognized you!

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.520
Rosalie!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.540
Jeanne!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:13.940
It's been so long!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.880
I'm so glad you came to see me!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.350
I'm so happy...

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.870
I...

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.340
...was worried you might send me away.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.590
Mom has been feeling sick.

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:27.390
So... that's why I need
a little bit of money...

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.790
I see... You poor thing.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.390
There's no need for you to hesitate.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.840
Here, come in.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.800
Have you seen the new Queen?

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.960
Yes, she looked so brilliant.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:45.680
My, I wonder where that girl is from?
She's dressed rather filthily.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:49.740
She's a maid who worked
at my countryside home.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:52.010
She came all this way seeking my help.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:55.150
Oh, I see. How kind of you to help her.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:59.370
Now, Rosalie, wait in that room over there.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.110
Y-Yes, Lady Jeanne.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.360
<i>She had to...</i>

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.990
<i>Jeanne is a princess now.</i>

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:22.600
<i>She couldn't tell those ladies that we're sisters.</i>

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:25.780
<i>But it's fine.</i>

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:29.220
<i>She cried when she saw me.
She's still the same Jeanne inside.</i>

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:31.560
Who is it?!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.360
I'm Nicolas de la Motte.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.820
Lady Jeanne's lover!

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:39.990
I'll make sure you never threaten
my Jeanne ever again!

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.280
Threaten?!
What are you talking about?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.200
Wait, I just came to see my sister...

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.190
Shut up!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.170
This must be some kind of mistake!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.190
Shut up!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:04.220
You threatened to tell everyone that Jeanne used
to be a beggar, unless she gave you money!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.600
That's a lie!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.430
Who would say such a thing?!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.200
Jeanne did.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:13.540
Did you really think you could threaten
her with such a cheap story?!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.980
Jeanne did...?!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.110
You're lying!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.580
You're lying! Lies!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.240
What?!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.340
Jeanne would never say such a thing!

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:22.900
It's no lie!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:26.140
Jeanne came to me and said I could kill you!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.150
Jeanne did...?!

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.540
That's a lie!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.580
<i>Jeanne tried to have me killed...!</i>

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.590
<i>Jeanne, my own sister!</i>

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.620
<i>I should have known my visit was unwelcome!</i>

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.640
<i>At such a crucial time,</i>

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:46.760
<i>I can't have someone like you who knows my past appear, as you're nothing but trouble!</i>

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:49.730
<i>All of my efforts could end in vain.</i>

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:53.370
<i>Now that you've learned your lesson,
don't ever show yourself here again!</i>

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.040
<i>How terrifying!</i>

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.980
<i>You're frightening, Jeanne!</i>

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.210
<i>You've already begun to lose your heart!</i>

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:12.090
I chased away that beggar wench.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:15.460
Don't forget to knock before
you enter someone's room.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:19.330
Who cares if it's just you and me?

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.770
Don't act like you know me!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.210
B-But, you see...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.440
Jeanne, I'd do absolutely anything for you.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.890
I want to be helpful to you.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:44.970
<i>My next plan is to get rid of that
gullible Marquise of this manor.</i>

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:52.990
<i>This man is a bloody idiot,
but he might come in handy.</i>

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:04.040
<i>What am I going to do from tomorrow...?</i>

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.840
<i>There's no money left at our house
to buy even a slice of bread.</i>

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.050
Watch out, you idiot!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.980
I-I'm sorry, Your Lordship!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.320
Forgive me!

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:24.730
Please forgive me!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:31.360
For a raggedly dressed girl, you're quite the beauty.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.440
Say, girl. What do you say?

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.620
Why don't you come and spend
the night at my manor?

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:39.210
I'll pay you plenty of money!

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:41.010
What do you think you're doing?!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.510
Ow!

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.910
Count Mirabeau!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.450
Count Mirabeau.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:48.690
Damn pretty-faced broad!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:52.620
Count Mirabeau, please restrain yourself.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:56.220
Weren't you... um, cozy, with a singer from
the Opera House last night, as well?

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:59.230
Yeah, she was nothing special.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.110
<i>Why don't you come and spend
the night at my manor?</i>

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.470
<i>I'll pay you plenty of money!</i>

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.750
Plenty of money...

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:12.730
Money...

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.910
Me...?

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.580
B-But I...

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.040
No,

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.460
if I can get paid for it...

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.200
Y-Your Lordship!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.830
Stop the carriage.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.470
Um...

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.660
Please...

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:46.270
Please buy me for one night!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.660
Now that's a new one!

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.130
Hey, hey, you're mistaken.

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.820
It may be hard to tell, but I'm a woman.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:04.120
I couldn't buy you, even if you were free.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.410
Well, well.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:16.370
Who would have thought there'd
be such an adorable prostitute?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.480
Girl, what is your name?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.450
Rosalie...

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:22.550
Rosalie, huh?

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:24.790
Why would you do such a stupid thing?

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.690
My mother is sick,

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.820
but I can't find any work, so...

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.820
That's why I...!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.590
Here, Rosalie.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:35.780
It's not much, but take this.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.020
Don't ever resort to something this stupid again.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:41.910
All right?

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:55.550
One gold livre...!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.680
It's a lot of money!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:58.750
Tell me your name!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:17:59.640
Lady in the carriage!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.390
<i>Young girls like her are selling their bodies?</i>

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.460
<i>I had no idea...</i>

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:12.930
<i>What is happening to our society
and the people's lives?</i>

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:22.470
Nicolas.

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.920
Do you really love me that much?

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.680
O-Of course!

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.990
This much...

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:32.920
I see...

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.990
Then, do you want to marry me no matter what?

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:39.380
W-Why ask if you already know, Jeanne?

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:42.350
Fine then, I'll marry you.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.960
Beautiful Jeanne, you torment me like the devil!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:54.130
How about becoming a servant to that devil and
make the Boulainvilliers family fortunes ours?

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.280
J-Jeanne?!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:01.730
I hear there's a man named Rétaux, who is very
good at forging other people's handwriting.

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:05.240
They say he's especially good
at forging wills, Nicolas.

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.330
Fire!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.390
The manor of Marquise Boulainvilliers is on fire!

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:19.030
Marquise Boulainvilliers
is my mother's friend!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.010
André, let's go!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:24.410
Jeanne!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.810
Where is Jeanne?!

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:27.270
Ah, Jeanne!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.730
Hurry and escape!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.860
Jeanne, what is the meaning of this?!

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.040
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.760
Jeanne, have you gone mad?!

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:44.160
There!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.540
S-Stop, Nicolas!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.790
Auntie...

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:24.530
How could my aunt, who was
so kind to me, pass away?

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.820
Who is that woman?

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:33.400
I hear she's Marquise Boulainvilliers' distant relative and a descendant of the Valois Dynasty, Jeanne.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.340
Jeanne?

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.540
You didn't hear about her?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:41.570
It's Cardinal Rohan.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.520
You mean, the...?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.850
Yes. He was the previous Ambassador to Austria.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.060
However, his pursuit of women was so overt...

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:52.030
...that it caused Lady Antoinette's mother,
Lady Maria Theresa, to dislike him...

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:54.100
...and have him recalled from his post.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.860
Why would a man like that be here?

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:01.740
Hey, Jeanne.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:02.440
That man...

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.570
Yes, I invited him.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:05.870
Wh-What?!

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.810
You went out of your way
and invited that lecher?!

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:13.010
Regardless of what kind of man he is,
he's the highest-ranking clergyman in France.

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.830
It'd be foolish not to use such an easy mark.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:20.840
We should thank God that he was
friends with Marquise Boulainvilliers.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.530
If she truly were a descendant
of the Valois Dynasty,

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.140
she would have a residence
at the Palace of Versailles...

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.690
...and have the rank of Duchess by now.

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:38.800
Th-This is...?

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.650
This is Marquise Boulainvilliers' will?

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.810
Yes, she gave it to me a while back.

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:48.440
Please have a look.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.000
Th-There's no doubt.

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:53.700
I'm certain this is the Marquise's handwriting.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.810
''I bequeath all of my family
fortunes to Jeanne Valois...''

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:00.320
She left everything to you!

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:11.540
<i>I can't put my finger on it,</i>

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:15.510
<i>but a woman who has the eyes of a roaring fire,
together with Rohan, a corrupt priest...</i>

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:16.980
<i>Those two together...</i>

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:19.940
<i>I sense something terrible is about to come.</i>

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:32.210
